32800 ' glass (texture 200, 64 x 60): a pale blue pane with a wooden frame and a cross of bars, index 0 is see-through; the wall that carries it is translucent (flag 16)
32810 PROC MAKEGLASS
32820   GFX CLEAR 0
32830   GFX LINE 3,3,60,56,FN W3K_C(7,13),BF
32840   GFX LINE 8,8,20,10,FN W3K_C(0,15),BF
32850   GFX LINE 12,14,16,22,FN W3K_C(0,15),BF
32860   GFX LINE 0,0,63,2,FN W3K_C(12,5),BF
32870   GFX LINE 0,57,63,59,FN W3K_C(12,5),BF
32880   GFX LINE 0,0,2,59,FN W3K_C(12,5),BF
32890   GFX LINE 61,0,63,59,FN W3K_C(12,5),BF
32900   GFX LINE 30,0,33,59,FN W3K_C(12,6),BF
